{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "a1998d9be9891c57d48a280cda4d7000e60a4ed09201b024b1234dc9e4390dee", "ja": "えっと？　背筋を意識して、\n体幹をまっすぐに……はあ、なるほどなぁ。", "zh": "呃？注意保持背部挺直，\n让身体核心保持笔直……啊，原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
