{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "37757ead5e2256f6cf03ef76f104f4de417cd346e25d9be8959ae59fa0368f6c", "ja": "ち、違います！　まあ、最初にデザイン見た時は、\n結構大胆で恥ずかしいなーとか思いましたけど。", "zh": "不、不是！不过，刚看到设计的时候，我确实觉得挺大胆的，怪不好意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "a36127b1d21eebf4003184db5d0d5b73c6ecc75210bc3d604ca2f6fdeff24ee1", "ja": "着てみたら、意外としっくりくるというか……\nこんなんもアリやんって！　でもその代わり……はぁ。", "zh": "穿上之后，意外地还挺合身的……\n这种也不是不行嘛！不过相对的……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1006_p", "source_sha256": "655e6dce5de2974b3ec4c9ed0ca6f236a19d05a1f038246a64b6f0a0f8659d4e", "ja": "何かあったのか？", "zh": "发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "2995c720168cc43083d24e9e5947f119d425b7ef1ed0b89fbf847e89de4b392d", "ja": "実は、アニキに衣装の写真見せたんです。そしたら……\nああー！　ほんま見せるんやなかったわ！", "zh": "其实，我把服装的照片拿给我哥看了。结果……\n啊啊——！真不该拿给他看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "d712abe83fe6cd3b5071975048f49799a6b1bdb98d1a7e21e5fc109bb3eb8ae0", "ja": "アニキ、「露出が多いから甘いもんは控えろ」って。\n余計なお世話やと思いません！？", "zh": "大哥说：“因为露得太多了，甜食还是少吃点吧。”  \n您不觉得这根本是多管闲事吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3806b791f15361aa1765e823e73110c9d1c18c73f95b1de081d2110f8308d006", "ja": "な、なるほど。\n露出の多さで怒るとかじゃないんだな？", "zh": "这、这样啊。  \n原来不是因为露得多就生气啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "629b7e432421fcc7e7c8174c33e2aedede7a4b4f8d81c022f268a121c9e226ca", "ja": "それはないですね。肌を見せるならもっと鍛えろ。\nプロならちゃんとやれとか、そんなんばっかで。", "zh": "不是那回事。说什么要露肌肤就得多锻炼，既然是专业人士就该好好做，净是这些话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "ca7ba5414556989678f589396ab4c8d1c0dca8ed67cf3ddd466f577e406b4e06", "ja": "しかも、「効果的に鍛える方法があるけど聞くか？」\nって！　……まあ、教えてもらいましたけど。", "zh": "而且还说：“我有个能有效锻炼的方法，要听听吗？”\n……不过，我确实让他教我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6703b436264e0026ce327c88f02d0254fba59694867d87029d4b5c0de6188698", "ja": "教えてもらったのか……。", "zh": "还真告诉你了啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "a963e6cdd4804006dd466d34d7dddb98a86e2edb924e53fe1349a6ccd88fb0cb", "ja": "はい。言われたとおりするんはシャクでした\nけど……やってみたら、意外と効果があって。", "zh": "是的。虽然照他说的做让我有点不爽，\n但试了一下，没想到还挺有效的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1014_p", "source_sha256": "49640bebbbeb6c96e07badb4dcd360a200ccf5bf8202352f9a07e1ca2353063c", "ja": "おおっ。さすがプロサッカー選手直伝だな！", "zh": "哦！不愧是职业足球运动员亲自传授的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "b56ed209f9832f263a7d454bc15cb0527ab77ad519c7629317000edbe0cd0fe3", "ja": "そうですね。うるさいとこもありますけど、\nなんやかんやで頼りになるアニキです。", "zh": "是啊。虽然有时候挺吵的，但不管怎么说，还是个很可靠的大哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "f6e469569492ca429929f690feb912060d03f4bd73d7cfc6e3601ca7ba5796d0", "ja": "でも、いつまでも子供扱いされてるみたいで、\nなんかイヤなんですよね……。はあ～。", "zh": "可是，总觉得一直被当成小孩子对待，心里有点不舒服……唉～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0214_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b3ea89acdfc3ada135bafc7b8ad5f06db164a6014fbab26f9bf1a54ab9395c9d", "ja": "なら、チャンスじゃないか？　この衣装で、\n大人っぽい奈緒を見せる絶好の機会だと思うけど。", "zh": "那不正是个机会吗？我觉得这可是穿上这身服装，展现成熟奈绪的绝佳机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
